:: Fishing Moor Spiked Drink 1
<<drugs 180>>

You set the can down and something feels wrong almost immediately, a warmth that spreads too fast, a faint blur creeping in at the edges of your vision.
<br><br>

You blink. The moor looks further away than it should, and the sound of the water is oddly distant. Your legs feel unreliable beneath you. Why is the ground moving towards you?
<br><br>

<<link [[...|Fishing Moor Spiked Drink 2]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Spiked Drink 2
<<bind>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_hiker_1">><<person1>>
<<loadNPC 1 "moor_hiker_2">><<person2>>

You come to on the ground. Heather pressed against your cheek. Your wrists are bound behind you. You try to rise, but can't manage it. Your head is heavy, thoughts slow and thick.
<br><br>

The <<group>> stands over you, grinning. "Thought that'd take longer." "What an idiot." They advance on you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Spiked Drink Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>


